{"reviews":[{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-0","r":1.0,"t":"Flimsy!","x":"Beware! This is NOT the original Toe Buddy. This is a flimsy copy, too big for any toes.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-1","r":1.0,"t":"Didn't work for me","x":"I bought 2 of these. The first kept folding in half on my big toe and was very uncomfortable.  The second seemed to work and was comfortable in the beginning, but now I have a massive blister on my second toe.  Don't know if my toes are too small, or this is just a faulty product.  Great idea, but perhaps poor execution.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-2","r":5.0,"t":"Good toe separators!","x":"These are very good to help keep your toes supported & separated. Clean & store in a ziplock with nice body powder sprinked inside to keep them soft & easy to apply to your toes.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-3","r":2.0,"t":"Not as Expected","x":"I received the Visco-GEL Toe Buddy promptly.  It even arrived early. The product was not as expected.  It was entirely to big. It fit my big toe well but was to big, and it constantly slipped off my second toe.  When I stretched it to my other toes it hurt.  Maybe I have small toes.  It did not fit properly, and I will not order again.  Its not worth my time returning the product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-4","r":5.0,"t":"Don't wear them to bed or in swimming.","x":"It works! But take it off at night or in swimming. I wore it for several days straight, day and night, and the spongy material started to create rash on both toes and remove layers of skin. Stopped wearing them, apply A & D Ointment between the toes at night and so far no more problem. Will use the Toe Buddy when pain recurs but be smarter about it. I'm a believer!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-5","r":4.0,"t":"Takes pressure off","x":"You don't realize the strain on your toes until you get them back in alignment. These work well for me. I own correct toes, but not all of my shoes are wide enough for me to were them, so I got these to wear on with not so wide shoes. They are working fine for me. My feet feel so good with the pressue off that I never realized I had.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-6","r":5.0,"t":"Quick & easy to use","x":"These are easy to put on and take off, and are reusable.  They not only protect my hammertoe joint from rubbing, but also have the separator between the toes.  It's not meant to straighten the hammertoe, but does keep them in place.  Good value, and easy to use over again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-7","r":3.0,"t":"Toe buddies","x":"When they make these products, they never seem to account for the fact that a broken toe may stay larger at the joint than before it was broken, so even large does not fit well and constricts the toe. It is very flexible. Would have returned, but too expensive to do so.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-8","r":5.0,"t":"The spacers are extremely comfortable and you don't even know you're wearing them","x":"The spacers are extremely comfortable and you don't even know you're wearing them.  I like them so much and, since I wear flip-flops a lot, I have ordered 2 more sets, just to have on hand to keep in my cars and golf bag, when I have to wear regular shoes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-9","r":4.0,"t":"Works","x":"I have overlapping toes and bunions on the same foot.  works pretty well but does tend to work its way down and doesn't hold the toe off the other one for the whole day.  But is better with it than without.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-10","r":5.0,"t":"Worked for me","x":"I was surprised how quickly and painlessly this toe buddy helped realign my toes. I have much less pain and I quickly could see a change. It wears well and washes easily and is comfortable to wear.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-11","r":3.0,"t":"OK, but.....not worth the money","x":"They almost do the job that they were intended for, but they stretch to much and are poorly made, so think twice before buying this product. Better material would make this a much better product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-12","r":1.0,"t":"Do not waste your money on this","x":"Do not waste your money on this.  They took forever to get here from China and it is like a giant piece of calamari that didn't even fit my husband's big feet and toes.  Sadly a bad purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-13","r":3.0,"t":"Other than this they are fairly comfortable. Not sure how effective they will be overall","x":"These don't fit very well.  OK on the big toe but it will not sit straight on 2nd toe.  Other than this they are fairly comfortable.  Not sure how effective they will be overall.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-14","r":1.0,"t":"It doesn't work","x":"This was a waste of money. It is so thin and flimsy that I couldn't put socks over it because it would rub up. I needed it to keep my toes separated and it could not do that.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-15","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent solution to toe corn between toes","x":"My 92 year old Mom has a corn on her 2nd toe which hurts and irritates her big toe too.  This soft gel-like toe guard works well and has eliminated pain.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-16","r":5.0,"t":"Provided good support for a broken, crooked big toe","x":"I bought this for a broken, big toe that needed support. It has helped to straighten out the toe somewhat, and has been good for support.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-17","r":2.0,"t":"Toe Buddy","x":"I didn't particularly like the toe buddy. They were sticky and lost their shape. The idea was good, but made from another material.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-18","r":2.0,"t":"I was disappointed. The one size fits all is a misnomer","x":"I was disappointed.  The one size fits all is a misnomer. The toe loops kept sliding off because they were too wide for my toes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-19","r":5.0,"t":"Highly recommend","x":"Perfect!  Comfortable & can stretch enough for more than one toe.  Super soft & can't feel them while wearing shoes.  Love them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2014"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-20","r":5.0,"t":"Good for keeping toes separated","x":"This works great unless you have fractured your second toe as I did.  However, on the other foot it is perfectly comfortable.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-21","r":5.0,"t":"These work great except don't last long","x":"These work great  except don't last long..maybe 3 or 4 weeks.  Will definitely buy more though as solves the problem","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-22","r":5.0,"t":"but better than nothing","x":"Just wish there was a medium size....hoping these will stretch as they are a bit tight, but better than nothing.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-23","r":5.0,"t":"GREAT BARGIN","x":"They work great..... I was looking for just 2 each but I got 4 each which was a surprise. Makes a great  bargin.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00FW6JXNM-24","r":4.0,"t":"So far working ok","x":"Seems to work better than other types I've tried so am pleased with it - probably would recommend it for others","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Several reviewers find the product too big or poorly fitting, especially on smaller toes.","cites":[1,2,4,8,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers report the product is flimsy, thin, or poorly made and stretches too much.","cites":[1,12,13,15]},{"text":"A number of reviewers say the separators are comfortable and easy to put on and take off.","cites":[3,7,9,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product helps relieve pressure, support, or realign their toes.","cites":[3,6,7,10,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers experienced skin irritation, blistering, or rash from wearing the product.","cites":[2,5]}]},"qa":[]}